Privacy Policy for Job Application Tracker

Job Application Tracker does not collect, store, or transmit any personal data.

All job tracking information (such as job titles, URLs, statuses, and notes) is stored locally in your browser and never sent to any server or third party. The extension does not use analytics, trackers, or external code.

We do not sell, share, or transfer any user data. The extension works fully offline, and no login is required.

If you have any questions or concerns, feel free to contact the developer.
